{"id":3403,"slug":"3403-ref-unwrapping-trong-templates-va-reactive-objects-hoat-dong-the-nao","category":"Vue.js","subcategory":"Reactivity","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Ref unwrapping trong templates và reactive objects hoạt động thế nào?","question_en":"How does ref unwrapping work in templates and reactive objects?","answer_vi":"Vue tự động unwrap refs trong một số contexts — hiểu rõ để tránh bugs:\n\n**Template auto-unwrap**: refs được auto-unwrap trong template, không cần `.value`:\n```vue\n<script setup>\nconst count = ref(0)\nconst state = reactive({ count: ref(0) })\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <!-- Tự động unwrap — không cần .value -->\n  <p>{{ count }}</p>\n  <p>{{ state.count }}</p>\n</template>\n```\n\n**Reactive object unwrap**: ref là property của reactive object được tự động unwrap khi access:\n```typescript\nconst count = ref(0)\nconst state = reactive({ count })  // Wrap ref trong reactive\n\nconsole.log(state.count)  // 0, không phải Ref<0> — auto-unwrap!\nstate.count++             // Tương đương count.value++\nconsole.log(count.value)  // 1 — linked!\n```\n\n**Không unwrap**: ref trong array hoặc Map KHÔNG tự động unwrap:\n```typescript\nconst list = reactive([ref(0)])\nconsole.log(list[0].value)  // Phải dùng .value!\n\nconst map = reactive(new Map([['key', ref(0)]]))\nconsole.log(map.get('key').value)  // Phải dùng .value!\n```","answer_en":"Vue auto-unwraps refs in certain contexts:\n\n**Template auto-unwrap**: no `.value` needed in templates:\n```vue\n<script setup>\nconst count = ref(0)\n</script>\n<template>\n  <p>{{ count }}</p>  <!-- Auto-unwrapped -->\n</template>\n```\n\n**Reactive object unwrap**: ref as reactive property is auto-unwrapped:\n```typescript\nconst count = ref(0)\nconst state = reactive({ count })  // Wrap\nconsole.log(state.count)  // 0, not Ref<0>\nstate.count++; console.log(count.value)  // 1 — linked!\n```\n\n**No auto-unwrap**: refs in arrays or Maps are NOT unwrapped:\n```typescript\nconst list = reactive([ref(0)])\nconsole.log(list[0].value)  // Must use .value\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Vue tự động unwrap refs trong một số contexts — hiểu rõ để tránh bugs:</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Template auto-unwrap</strong>: refs được auto-unwrap trong template, không cần <code>.value</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup&gt;\nconst count = ref(0)\nconst state = reactive({ count: ref(0) })\n&lt;/script&gt;\n\n&lt;template&gt;\n  &lt;!-- Tự động unwrap — không cần .value --&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;{{ count }}&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;{{ state.count }}&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/template&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">setup</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"language-javascript\">\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> count = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">ref</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> state = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">reactive</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">count</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">ref</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>) })\n</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Tự động unwrap — không cần .value --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>{{ count }}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>{{ state.count }}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Reactive object unwrap</strong>: ref là property của reactive object được tự động unwrap khi access:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const count = ref(0)\nconst state = reactive({ count })  // Wrap ref trong reactive\n\nconsole.log(state.count)  // 0, không phải Ref&lt;0&gt; — auto-unwrap!\nstate.count++             // Tương đương count.value++\nconsole.log(count.value)  // 1 — linked!\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> count = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">ref</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> state = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">reactive</span>({ count })  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Wrap ref trong reactive</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(state.<span class=\"hljs-property\">count</span>)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 0, không phải Ref&lt;0&gt; — auto-unwrap!</span>\nstate.<span class=\"hljs-property\">count</span>++             <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Tương đương count.value++</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(count.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 1 — linked!</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Không unwrap</strong>: ref trong array hoặc Map KHÔNG tự động unwrap:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const list = reactive([ref(0)])\nconsole.log(list[0].value)  // Phải dùng .value!\n\nconst map = reactive(new Map([['key', ref(0)]]))\nconsole.log(map.get('key').value)  // Phải dùng .value!\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> list = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">reactive</span>([<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">ref</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)])\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(list[<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>].<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Phải dùng .value!</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> map = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">reactive</span>(<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Map</span>([[<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;key&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">ref</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)]]))\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(map.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;key&#x27;</span>).<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Phải dùng .value!</span></code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Vue auto-unwraps refs in certain contexts:</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Template auto-unwrap</strong>: no <code>.value</code> needed in templates:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup&gt;\nconst count = ref(0)\n&lt;/script&gt;\n&lt;template&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;{{ count }}&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;!-- Auto-unwrapped --&gt;\n&lt;/template&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" strok