3\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> list = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">reactive</span>([<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">ref</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)])\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(list[<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>].<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Must use .value</span></code></pre></div>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3209-reactivity-system-trong-vue-3-hoat-dong-the-nao","title":"Reactivity system trong Vue 3 hoạt động thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3210-ref-vs-reactive-khac-nhau-gi-dung-khi-nao","title":"`ref` vs `reactive` — khác nhau gì? Dùng khi nào?"},{"url":"/q/3211-computed-vs-watch-vs-watcheffect-dung-khi-nao","title":"`computed` vs `watch` vs `watchEffect` — dùng khi nào?"},{"url":"/q/3200-vue-js-la-gi-khac-react-angular-the-nao","title":"Vue.js là gì? Khác React/Angular thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3201-options-api-vs-composition-api-khac-nhau-gi","title":"Options API vs Composition API — khác nhau gì?"},{"url":"/q/3202-script-setup-la-gi-loi-ich-so-voi-setup-thong-thuong","title":"`<script setup>` là gì? Lợi ích so với `setup()` thông thường?"},{"url":"/q/3204-single-file-component-sfc-la-gi","title":"Single File Component (SFC) là gì?"},{"url":"/q/3205-cac-directive-pho-bien-trong-vue-v-if-v-show-v-for-v-model-v-bind-v-on","title":"Các directive phổ biến trong Vue: v-if, v-show,